# Everything here runs on Linux or macOS, and must keep LF also when the repository is checked out
# or archived on Windows (core.autocrlf=true): bash stops at `set -euo pipefail\r`. The Windows
# installer's bundle is a `git archive`, and a hosted Windows runner is such a machine.
*.sh          text eol=lf
*.mjs         text eol=lf
*.py          text eol=lf
rootfs/bin/*  text eol=lf
VERSION       text eol=lf
